Instalar app 1.3.2 (bucket main, 64bit)
  1. Instalar o lançador de comandos em C:\W\shims\.launcher\shim.exe
  2. Baixar [1] https://storage.googleapis.com/antigravity-public/antigravity-cli/1.3.2-5813501495738368/windows-x64/cli_windows_x64.exe (antigravity-cli.exe, sha512 088f449e742a72444539088df261db30010c8dee16dc32920eede24c8ab497ce3da410dd42fe4d673a36eb0c5084411399ba44f77f96389130a36027696f2120)
  3. Copiar [1] antigravity-cli.exe para C:\W\apps\app\.staging-1.3.2
  4. Mover C:\W\apps\app\.staging-1.3.2 para C:\W\apps\app\1.3.2
  5. Apontar C:\W\apps\app\current -> C:\W\apps\app\1.3.2 (junção)
  6. Criar comando antigravity-cli em C:\W\shims (antigravity-cli.exe + antigravity-cli.shim) -> C:\W\apps\app\current\antigravity-cli.exe
  7. Criar comando agy em C:\W\shims (agy.exe + agy.shim) -> C:\W\apps\app\current\antigravity-cli.exe
  8. Garantir C:\W\shims no PATH do usuário
  9. Registrar app 1.3.2 (main) em C:\W\state.db
